# GS19: from the kolima_cliff save (Kolima Forest's floodgate, from the cliff; continue with vale_day1_continue.keys +
# --flash-in). South to the Floodgate Switch (19,28; beside the sign "Do not touch Floodgate Switch!"): examining it from
# 19,27 opens the floodgate (spray, the top lines shake) and the river falls; down the slope (row 20) onto the riverbed,
# round to the north-south log's east side (12,10): walking west rolls it to column 10 (KolimaForestFloodgate_RollLog);
# back to the switch, which closes the gate (churning spray) and the river rises with the logs floating (jump cells):
# over the west-east log (row 18), up the north-south log (column 13), along row 12 to the moved log (column 10), the
# jump north from 10,9 to the bank (10,7), north to the exit (9,2): the scene where Tret stands (f6280). Battles by
# autowalk's A taps.
